// Signing lives here, not in the generated project file.
//
// project.pbxproj is regenerated by tools/make_project.py, so anything Xcode
// writes into it can be wiped by the next regeneration. That is fine for build
// phases and file references, and not fine for your Apple team id: losing it
// means the next device build fails with "Signing requires a development team"
// for no visible reason.
//
// The optional include below picks up Local.xcconfig if it exists.
// Local.xcconfig is gitignored, so your team id never enters the repository
// and never gets clobbered. Copy Local.xcconfig.example to get started, or
// just set the team in Xcode: the generator preserves whatever it finds.

#include? "Local.xcconfig"
